{
  "comment": "Fixed ESLint config for the quality reading Q (SPEC § 5). Frozen before round 1. The 'comment' key is dropped before linting. ES built-ins come from ecmaVersion; browser globals are listed ('event' is the handler attribute's event). Inline eslint comments are ignored, so artifact code cannot switch a rule off.",
